00:00:24.525 --> 00:00:27.761 size:53% position:73% line:53%
 En ce moment, les très

00:00:25.626 --> 00:00:28.896 size:53% position:73% line:53%
contagieux BA.4 et BA.5

00:00:26.727 --> 00:00:31.098 size:53% position:73% line:53%
