00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:50.984 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ALAIN LAMAiriririrologue,

00:00:48.982 --> 00:00:51.919 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Institut national de recherche

00:00:50.117 --> 00:00:52.886 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- C'est amplement suffisant

00:00:51.085 --> 00:00:53.821 size:53% position:73% line:53%
