00:01:00.861 --> 00:01:06.333 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Heureusement, la vaccination

00:01:04.198 --> 00:01:07.468 size:53% position:73% line:53%
demeure une excellente

00:01:05.299 --> 00:01:08.602 size:53% position:73% line:53%
