00:01:55.983 --> 00:02:01.355 size:53% position:73% line:53%
comparaisons, mais

00:01:57.351 --> 00:02:02.723 size:53% position:73% line:53%
il va y avoir probablement

00:01:58.719 --> 00:02:04.091 size:53% position:73% line:53%
une petite compétition entre ce.

00:02:01.455 --> 00:02:05.425 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Heureusement, aucun d'entre

00:02:02.823 --> 00:02:06.794 size:53% position:73% line:53%
